//! twenty-five Wave 4 pool/record helpers, twenty-two Wave 5 player-actor
//! helpers, twenty-five Wave 9 map-object/attach helpers, twenty-four
//! Wave 12 effect/transition helpers, twenty-five Wave 27 action/landing
//! helpers, twenty-seven Wave 36 action-state helpers, thirty Wave 51
//! ice-object/record helpers, thirty Wave 55 assigned-bucket state-controller
//! helpers, thirty Wave 60 slip/move state helpers, twenty-six Wave 64
//! magma-object interaction helpers, twenty-seven Wave 66 iceball-projectile
//! helpers, twenty-six Wave 67 message-loader/state-controller helpers,
