//! | `0x80145BD0` | [`wm_start_anim`] | actor | start a long animation and the shared audio state |
//! | `0x80145C50` | [`wm_stop_anim`] | actor | stop the long animation and the shared audio state |
//! | `0x80102F90` | [`fn_80102f90`] | effect slots | construct the sub-object at `slot+0x24` |
//! | `0x80103000` | [`fn_80103000`] | effect slots | destroy the sub-object and optionally free the slot |
//! | `0x80103150` | [`fn_80103150`] | effect slots | initialise all `0x55` slot records |
