/// Converts a signed 16-bit value into a fraction of 3600, scaled by an
/// unsigned 16-bit global.
///
/// Reads the pointer at `param_1 + 0x18`, dereferences it once more to a signed
/// short, and divides `3600.0 * signed_short` by the 16-bit value at
/// `r13-0x7D52` (the body of `0x8006A230`, inlined here because the getter is a
/// single `lhz`).
