/// Writes `0x802F57C0`, `0x802F57C4`, `0x802F57C8` and `0x802F57CC` to actor
/// `+0x320`, `+0x324`, `+0x318` and `+0x31C`. The source values are `0`,
/// `20.0`, `15.0` and `22.0` in `main.elf`.
