/// Follows the attached target and swaps in the next handle.
///
/// A zero `+0x1520` handle is cleared and reports `0x80376E88`. Otherwise the
/// target height is subtracted from nine, the result (when below ten) is
/// stored in `+0x1548`, and `0x8014F590` runs when the distance test succeeds.
/// A target kind of `4` or `5` releases the handle and asks `0x80064610` for
/// the next one (`0x13`, `variant << 4`, or `<< 4 | 1`).
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8014F840` at `0x8014F840` (356 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8014f840_FUN_8014f840.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - attach controller.
