/// Tests whether the WorldMap player may start the spin action.
///
/// Reads the controller mode word at `controller+0x154`. Mode `0x75` always
/// refuses, and mode `0xB` refuses while the ground probe at
/// `0x80169020(controller+0x28)` fails. Every other mode is allowed.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801298B0` at `0x801298B0` (88 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801298b0_FUN_801298b0.c`
///
