/// Stops the landing sound on both the actor and its selected target.
///
/// Resolves the selection through [`wm_find_selected_actor`]; when that returns
/// an object, the same `0x800D8510(sound, id)` call runs for it and then for
/// the actor itself. The id is the signed halfword at `+0x17CE`.
