/// Applies the object's positional offsets to the shared player position.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8011FC00` at `0x8011FC00` (156 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8011fc00_FUN_8011fc00.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - magma-wave object; offsets are `+0x584..+0x58C`.
///
/// # Returns
