///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0xAC..+0xB4` of the object returned by `0x80162590`, then submits a
/// queried contact id through `0x8011EB00` when one is found.
///
/// # Safety
/// `object` must be live and `0x80162590` must return a live player.
