/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80124250` at `0x80124250` (224 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80124250_FUN_80124250.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - iceball actor; `+0x38D` selects the player, `+0x348` the state.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Rewrites `+0xE8` from the player's `+0xE8` through the flat/slope curve plus
/// the `0x8042D6C0` table, then stores `3.7`, `0.0`, `-0.15`, the
/// `0x8042D6C8` entry, `-3.0` and `0.04` into `+0xEC`, `+0xF0`, `+0x114`,
/// `+0xF4`, `+0x118` and `+0x11C`.
