/// Compares an object's name with a reference string after the last `:`.
///
/// `0x802E1C40` is `strrchr`; both names are advanced past their last colon
/// separator and then compared with `0x802E1AB4` (`strcmp`). The object name
/// comes from vtable slot `+0x20`.
