/// `+0x1C80`, `+0x1C84`; the heading `+0x102` is copied to `+0x1C90`; the
/// height delta `+0xAC - position.x` goes to `+0x1C88`; and `0.7f` seeds the
/// `+0x1C8C` slope field.
