/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801336E0` at `0x801336E0` (248 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801336e0_FUN_801336e0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - sled/slope WorldMap actor.
/// * `position` - pointer to three `f32` contact coordinates.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` on a valid contact, `0` when the name test fails.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One controller call and up to nine field writes.
///
/// # Safety
/// `position` must point at 12 readable bytes; `actor` and its controller must
/// be live.
///
/// # Confidence
