///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80141140` at `0x80141140` (476 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80141140_FUN_80141140.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - WorldMap player actor.
