/// Tests an incoming body and posts the trick-result word.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80137C10` at `0x80137C10` (528 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80137c10_FUN_80137c10.c`
///
