/// compares the candidate's `+0x38C`/`+0xE8`/`+0xB8`/`+0x348` fields. The
/// resulting `0..=5` (plus `0x100` in mode `6`) is posted on `+0x294`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this`, its `+0x1464` sub-object and `other` when non-zero must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
