/// The `countLeadingZeros`-based boolean: `true` when the selected word is
/// zero or has bit 31 set, `false` otherwise.
///
/// # Side effects
/// None; two table reads.
///
/// # Safety
/// `+0x38D` must index `0x80354E60` and the resulting index must index
/// `0x80354E90`.
