/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80117C50` at `0x80117C50` (368 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80117c50_FUN_80117c50.c`
/// - Removed: the `0x802DCD74`/`0x802DCDC0` prologue and epilogue pair
///   (`_savegpr_27`/`_restgpr_27`); the incoming `r3`/`r4` are the record and
///   index the export printed as that helper's "return".
