///   (`_savegpr_25`/`_restgpr_25`); the incoming `r3` is the owner and `r4` the
///   object the export printed as that helper's "return".
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `owner` - record whose `+0x4F4` is passed to `0x8016E3A0` (incoming `r3`).
/// * `object` - child list object (incoming `r4`).
