/// Releases the named state object and optionally frees the wrapper
/// (byte-identical to [`fn_8010bf30`]).
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8010EE80` at `0x8010EE80` (88 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8010ee80_FUN_8010ee80.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - object, possibly null.
/// * `free_base` - when positive, the wrapper is released.
///
/// # Returns
/// `this`, unchanged.
///
/// # Side effects
/// `0x8015F800(this, 0)` for every non-null `this`, then `0x802B9280(this)`
/// when `free_base > 0`.
