/// Returns the per-mode speed value for the actor's `+0x1090` mode word.
///
/// The table is `0x802F4E64` while `+0x14D4` is `0` or `1`, and `0x802F4E80`
/// otherwise; the mode word is used as a float index into that table.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80132530` at `0x80132530` (68 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80132530_FUN_80132530.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor whose `+0x14D4` selector and `+0x1090` index are read.
///
