/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0x114`/`+0x10C`/`+0x11C`/`+0x110`/`+0xE8`/`+0xEC`/`+0x1C9C`
//// `+0x1C98`/`+0x102`/`+0x2A8`/`+0x14A4`/`+0x14AC`; calls `0x80147250`, two
/// sounds and up to two virtual slots.
///
