/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801129c0_FUN_801129c0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - course-background controller.
/// * `flag` - non-zero to skip the distance branch.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0x10C`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `+0xAC` must be readable and the scene global must hold a rail object.
