/// Per-frame ground contact of the ice/grid map object.
///
/// Probes the underside, advances the object's own `+0x5F4` height, and either
/// keeps it on the ground (`+0x5CC` speed test, `+0x274` bit `0x200000`), arms
/// the detach path, or posts the `0x803757B8` contact record. State `+0x614 == 5`
