// `if ((unaff_GQR0 & 0x3f00) != 0) { ldexpf(...); }`. In every record selected
// here the `ldexpf` result is discarded and every float operand is a plain `r2`// load, so no value in the body depends on the `GQR0` scale. Records where a
// value does flow through `ldexpf`/`CONCAT` stay untranslated; see
// `docs/COVERAGE_WAVE102_WORLDMAP.md`.
