// * `0x80135070..0x8013A880` - the ground/ride contact group: the height
//   probes (`0x800757B0`/`0x80075CA0`/`0x80075FD0`), the `0x801396C0`//   slide-contact commit, the ride variant reset and the dismount hand-over.
