/// Runs the ride state machine's `+0x2060` re-arm and event gate.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80130340` at `0x80130340` (444 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80130340_FUN_80130340.c`
