/// Publishes the horizontal ride distance and the mount offsets.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8013BB90` at `0x8013BB90` (572 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8013bb90_FUN_8013bb90.c`
