/// passed to `0x80237BD0` (stored as `-(4.0 * speed) * result` at `+0xE8`) and
/// to `0x80237C40` (stored as `speed * result` at `+0xEC`). `+0xF0` is cleared
/// and `+0xE8` is finally offset by the `+0x5D8` easing produced by
/// `0x8015F480(0.0, 0.05, +0x5D8)`.
