/// `0x80237C40` and `0x8015F480`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live and `+0x5D8` writable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the clamp ladder, both trig calls and the three stores are literal;
/// `GQR3` is the unsigned-16-bit `0x00050005` value (see [`fn_8011d930`]) and
/// `0x8015F480` is called with the two doubles the export prints.
