/// Scales the actor's `+0xEC` field from the magnitude of `+0x10C`.
///
/// `+0x10C` is compared against the reference height returned by `0x80057650`
/// plus three `r2` thresholds (`2.8`, `1.5`, `0.7`), selecting `0.3`, `0.24`,
/// `0.18` or leaving `0.0`. The status word `+0x10D4` then picks one of the
/// `3.628`, `3.5` and `2.3` bases, and `3.628` is added to the selected value.
///
