/// Advances the fall actor's `+0x5F0` sine motion and its `+0x5F8` contact
/// state.
///
/// The helper first starts the `+0x104` halfword ladder toward `0`, probes
/// the ground into `+0x5F4` and classifies the height delta into `+0x5F8`:
/// `1` (unchanged), `2` (rising) or `3` (falling). States `2`/`3` ease `+0xB0`
/// toward `ground - 0.5 * +0x5B8` with rate `r2 - 0x5A90` and then clamp it to
/// `ground - 0.3 * +0x5B8` while falling. State `1` advances the `+0x5F0`
/// halfword by `0x280` and writes `ground - 0.5 * +0x5B8 + gain * sin(angle/256)`
/// with `0x80237BD0`. The tail runs the `+0x1EC` collider query and either
/// reports contact state `2` with event `0x803756F8` or detaches through
/// `0x8011EBB0`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80120310` at `0x80120310` (452 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80120310_FUN_80120310.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `object`: WorldMap fall/splash actor with `+0xAC..+0xB8`, `+0x1EC`,
///   `+0x394`, `+0x5F0..+0x5F8`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
