/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8012DFB0` at `0x8012DFB0` (356 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8012dfb0_FUN_8012dfb0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `out`: three writable floats.
/// - `object`: player actor with `+0x60`, `+0x2A64` and `+0xB0`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
