/// branch on `+0x5F0`, the size-class guard and every printed operand are
/// literal. Four `0x801C0BD0` sites drop all three float arguments in the
/// export (`FUN_801c0bd0(param_1 + 0x5fc)` and the two `auStack_*` sites);
/// they are reconstructed as the all-zero translation used for identity
