///   mode `1` and sets status bit `0xA7`.
/// - `mode`: incoming `r5`. `1` selects sub-controller mode `3`, `2` selects
///   mode `4`; any other value leaves the sub-controller untouched.
/// - `variant`: incoming `r6`. Becomes the third payload word and selects
///   message argument `1` (instead of `2`) for `0x803762F0`.
/// - `first`: incoming `f1`. Compared with `0.0`, halved into the pose call,
///   and either used as the zero case message selector or stored in the
///   payload record.
/// - `second`: incoming `f2`. Halved into the pose call and written to
///   `+0x10C`.
