/// When event flag `188` (`0xBC`) is set the body clears it and returns `1`.
/// Otherwise it releases the display wrapper at `+0x2A60` with `0x800D7020`
/// (`0x800D6DF0`'s counterpart) and also returns `1`.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
