///   popped through `0x8005D0D0(table)`, then `+0x1454` picks the transition:
///   mode `0` starts descriptor `0x8035476C` with mode `0`
///   (`0x8004E290`), releases per-index claims (`0x8004DE50`) and calls
///   `0x800543E0(this, 0)`; mode `1` starts descriptor `0x80354BEC` with mode
///   `4` only. Any other mode does nothing.
