// | 73 | `0x8032554C` | `+0x12C` | `0x8013FE00` | 120 | eject guard, then `0x80051080` |
// | 74 | `0x80325550` | `+0x130` | `0x8013FCE0` | 140 | forward to partner `+0x130` |
// | 75 | `0x80325554` | `+0x134` | `0x801405E0` | 140 | begin ride transition |
// | 79 | `0x80325564` | `+0x144` | `0x801415A0` | 4 | tail branch to empty leaf |
// | 80 | `0x80325568` | `+0x148` | `0x801415B0` | 124 | `0x4000` lift-flag sync |
