/// with the `mode` argument or falls into the reset path that clears `+0x484`,
/// clears flag `98`, applies `0.5`/`0.7` and applies the selected state.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Address: `0x8014C930`, 764 B (`bclr` at `0x8014CC28`; the next body starts
///   at `0x8014CC30`)
/// - Table: slot 221 of `0x8032679C`, i.e. vtable offset `+0x37C`
