/// Advances the shared update chain and then either posts `0x80375C2C` or
/// runs the `+0x14A4` movement ladder.
///
/// The body calls `0x8004C480`, the `+0x44C` slot, `0x8004B730` and
/// `0x8004C310`, and returns when the `+0x374` slot answers non-zero. Bit `0x60`
/// of `+0x10D4` triggers `0x8005E460(+0xEA4, 1)`. A non-zero `0x8012C5E0`
/// posts `0x80375C2C` with `1` and returns.
