/// `0x80169020`) or calls `0x80128190(this, 1)`. Otherwise it zeroes `+0x10C`;
/// when `0x8005E7A0(+0xEA4, 0)` succeeds and the element metric behind
/// `0x2A64 + 0x28` equals `10.0`, or `0x80169020` reports the element idle, it
/// calls `0x80128190(this, 1)`.
