// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x8012CB10 - table slot 227 (vtable +0x38C): counter reset and latch
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Resets the `+0x1558`/`+0x155C` counters, runs the `+0x448` slot,
/// `0x8012CF30` and `0x80047630`, then arms and fires the `+0x1560` latch.
///
/// The latch is set to `1` only when it is zero and bit `0x8000` of `+0x10D4`
/// is clear. A latch of exactly `1` calls `0x80145E40`.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Address: `0x8012CB10`, 136 B (`bclr` at `0x8012CB94`; the next body starts
///   at `0x8012CBA0`)
/// - Table: slot 227 of `0x80325428`, i.e. vtable offset `+0x38C`
/// - Reach: `vcall(object, 0x38C)`
/// - Not in `functions.tsv`; no Ghidra export
/// - Prologue `stwu r1,-16`/`mflr` with `r31` saved
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the WorldMap actor.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
