// WorldMap vtable `0x80325420` run `0x80325428` (wave 246, lane D)
// ===========================================================================
//
// Thirteenth pass over the world-map actor table. Wave 245 reached slot 252, so
// this pass resumes at slot 253 and takes the next ten uncovered words: 253,
