// |---:|---|---:|---|---:|---|
// | 253 | `0x80325814` | `+0x3F4` | `0x801460F0` | 224 | player match, three gates, shared effect |
// | 257 | `0x80325824` | `+0x404` | `0x80057B90` | 148 | clear speed, store angle, post layer |
// | 258 | `0x80325828` | `+0x408` | `0x80126510` | 288 | copy a three-float vector into `+0x14B0` |
// | 260 | `0x80325830` | `+0x410` | `0x80146E90` | 108 | set two angles and the `+0x2060` byte |
// | 261 | `0x80325834` | `+0x414` | `0x8004C990` | 208 | `+0x111C` -> action id, lazily built table |
// | 262 | `0x80325838` | `+0x418` | `0x80143580` | 8 | attach the special effect, kind `1` |
// | 263 | `0x8032583C` | `+0x41C` | `0x80143590` | 76 | request `0x36`, then attach kind `2` |
// | 265 | `0x80325844` | `+0x424` | `0x800576A0` | 180 | `+0xB4` from a capped countdown |
// | 266 | `0x80325848` | `+0x428` | `0x80057760` | 112 | `+0xB4` from the long-animation cap |
// | 268 | `0x80325850` | `+0x430` | `0x80057810` | 8 | clear the `0x99` flag |
//
