// `functions.tsv`. Slot 257 already had a body - the player-vtable pass wrote
// the same routine as its slot 255 - so this pass adds nine new bodies and
// points slot 257 at the existing one. Extents come from
// recursive descent from the table word: conditional branches and
// intra-function `b` targets are followed, `bl` callees are not, and the walk
// stops at `bclr`/`bcctr` with LK clear.
//
// Slot 262 is the six-word thunk `li r4,1` / `b 0x801435E0`, so a naive descent
// would swallow the shared tail at `0x801435E0`; that helper is a table row in
// its own right and is already translated as [`fn_801435e0`], which this pass
