// (translated in the player module as `fn_80056cb0`).
//
// This pass adds the data constants below. Everything else is reused:
// [`vcall0`]/[`vcall1`]/[`vcall60_2`], [`unsigned_to_double`], [`read_f64`],
// [`read_f32`]/[`write_f32`], the player predicates and flag helpers
// [`crate::game::player::fn_8004dd00`],
// [`crate::game::player::fn_80056cf0`],
// [`crate::game::player::fn_80056c70`],
// [`crate::game::player::fn_80056cb0`], the action post
// [`crate::game::player::fn_80058110`], [`fn_8012f970`], [`fn_801435e0`] and
// the effect band `FUN_800D8BB0` with its `SDA_5678_WORD` object.

