/// The player index at `+0x1090` must equal the active controller slot at
/// `+0x14E0`. The `+0x120` and `+0x3F0` slots must then answer zero, and the
/// `+0x450` slot must answer non-zero. All three original `bcctrl` calls still
/// carry the two incoming words in `r4`/`r5`, so the Rust forwards them.
