/// - Table: slot 253 of `0x80325428`, i.e. vtable offset `+0x3F4`
/// - Reach: `vcall(object, 0x3F4, a, b)`
/// - Not in `functions.tsv`; no Ghidra export
/// - Prologue `stwu r1,-32`/`mflr` with `r29`, `r30` and `r31` saved
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - WorldMap actor.
/// * `a`, `b` - arguments forwarded unchanged to all three virtual calls.
///
