/// is queried with [`DATA_80375E2C`] first and [`D246_DATA_80375F70`] second.
/// Each branch needs the record to answer non-zero and status flags `0x1C` /
/// `0x1F`, and then sets flag `0x22` before the copy. The two branches repeat
/// the record lookup rather than sharing it.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Address: `0x80126510`, 288 B (`bclr 20,0` at `0x8012662C`)
/// - Table: slot 258 of `0x80325428`, i.e. vtable offset `+0x408`
/// - Reach: `vcall(object, 0x408, vector)`
/// - Not in `functions.tsv`; no Ghidra export
/// - Prologue `stwu r1,-16`/`mflr` with `r30` and `r31` saved
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - WorldMap actor.
/// * `vector` - pointer to three singles read into `+0x14B0`, `+0x14B4` and
///   `+0x14B8`.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` when one of the two branches matched, otherwise `0`.
///
