/// - `index`: the caller's `r4`; only its low byte selects the entry.
///
/// # Returns
/// The sign-extended halfword at `B247_R2_564C_TABLE + (index & 0xFF) * 2`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// None.
///
/// # Safety
/// The selected table slot must be readable.
///
