/// Runs one frame of the course-entry controller.
///
/// Decrements the five entry timers at `+0x818` (halfword), `+0x81B` (byte),
/// `+0x7FC`, `+0x800` and `+0x808` (words), each floored at zero, and then
/// steps the `+0x7E4` countdown through [`fn_80111f90`]. While the global
/// course manager's `+0x15C` word is set it asks the `+0x394` name component
/// for the `0x803751C8` record and, when that name is absent, posts the record
/// through the controller's `+0xD4` slot.
