/// `+0x544` and `+0x584` animation records (slot `+0x1C`), the `+0x68C` record
/// (`+0x14`), the optional `+0x6B8` record (`+0x1C`, only when `+0x7EC` is
/// `1`), the `+0x394` component (`+0x10`) and the `+0x87C` countdown. Then
/// [`fn_80110b60`] refreshes the rail gate and the `+0x850` display record is
/// rewritten - the third and fourth words become `8800.0f`/`80.0f`, and its
/// `+0x0C` slot receives the position lifted by `15.0f`.
