/// Poses the two animation records from the current entry position.
///
/// Builds the angle triple from the signed halfwords `+0x100..+0x104` and the
/// position from `+0xAC..+0xB4`. `+0x7C4` is a sentinel: only when it equals
/// `8.0f` is it replaced by `+0x7C8`. The position is lifted by that value on X
/// and by `16.0f` on Y, run through `0x80064AF0` with the angles, written into
/// the `+0x7C` layout with `0x801C0BD0`, and the three axis setters
/// (`0x8016EDD0`/`0x8016ECB0`/`0x8016EEF0`) apply angles `+2`, `+0` and `+4`.
///
/// The `+0x544` record is bound to the layout, evaluated with `0x80168180`, and
/// the translation column (offsets `+0x0C`, `+0x1C`, `+0x2C` of the returned
/// record) is stored at `+0x78C..+0x794` before its `+0x14` slot runs. The
/// `+0x584` record is then posed the same way into a stack layout, but with Z
/// taken from `+0x7D0 - 64.0f`, and finally the `+0x850` display record's
/// `+0x10` slot runs. When `+0x7EC` is `1` the `+0x6B8` record's `+0x14` slot
