/// pointer returned by `0x80168180` must be readable for `0x30` bytes.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - every call, offset and constant is literal; the `+0x7C4` `8.0f`
/// sentinel follows from the `fcmpu`/`rlwinm.` boolean, whose `beq` skips the
/// `+0x7C8` load exactly when the comparison is not equal.
