// `daEnEatCoin_c` method array (the 158-slot vtable above, install pointer
// `0x80323368`). This pass closes the remaining eight in table order: slot 3
// `0x80110B00`, slot 23 `0x80111790`, slot 67 `0x80111570`, slot 73
