/// Updates the ice actor's contact position and model.
///
/// The body snapshots `+0xAC..+0xB4`, then, when `+0x60C` is clear, tests the
/// `+0x394` child for three names. The first hit copies [`fn_8011f1d0`]'s
/// three-float result into `+0xAC`; the second hit runs the `0x80072CB0`
/// range query and either lifts the actor to the `+0x5A8` height or copies
/// that height into `+0xB8..+0xC0`. The snapshot is then stored at
/// `+0x59C..+0x5A4`, the low nibble of the `r13 - 0x5986` input byte gates
/// [`fn_8011d930`], and the final two name tests select [`fn_8011d8c0`]
