///   `addi r31,r31,0x55A0`; `mr r30,r3`; `+0x60C` early-out; four
///   `vcall(+0x394,0x28)` + `vcall(result,0x14,<name>)` tests at
///   `0x803759B8`, `0x803758F8`, `0x80375638` and `0x80375A78`;
///   `bl 0x8011F1D0`, `bl 0x80072CB0`, `bl 0x8011D930`, `bl 0x8011D8C0`,
///   `bl 0x8011BE70`; `stfs` at `+0x59C/+0x5A0/+0x5A4`; epilogue; `blr`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `object`: ice-map actor.
///
