// ===========================================================================
// Wave 286 lane A (`_A286`): the seven uncovered methods of the WorldMap
// ice-projectile vtable `0x80324770`
// ===========================================================================
//
// ## Shape and identity
//
// `0x80324770`/`0x80324774` are both zero and `0x80324778..0x80324850` is a
// fifty-four-word method array. The installed pointer is the header, so the
// class dispatches through `[[this+0x60] + 8 + 4*slot]`. [`fn_801232b0`]
// allocates the `0x430`-byte actor, runs the base constructor, and stores
// `0x80324770` at `+0x60`; it also installs the second table `0x80317860` at
// `+0x40C`. The block is the WorldMap ice projectile documented in this file
// as `Wm_mr_iceball` (see the wave-66 block above).
//
// The identity is fixed by four shipped facts:
//
// * the header is materialised by `lis r4,0x8032` / `addi r4,r4,0x4770` at
//   `0x801232D8`/`0x801232E0` and stored with `stw r4,0x60(r31)` at
//   `0x801232E4` in [`fn_801232b0`];
// * the preceding data literal is `"Wm_ob_iceattack"` at
//   `0x80324750..0x80324760`; the same seven-name group starts at
//   `0x803246E8` (`"Wm_ob_icepoison"`, `"Wm_ob_iceevaporate"`,
//   `"Wm_ob_icethaw"`, `"Wm_ob_icebreak"`, `"Wm_ob_icehit"`,
//   `"Wm_ob_icewait"`, `"Wm_ob_iceattack"`);
// * slot 0 reads `+0x38D` (player), `+0x38F` (layer), `+0x348`/`+0x349`
//   (state and section byte) and the `Wm_ob_*` counters at `0x80375AA8` /
//   `0x80375AB8`, exactly the fields the wave-66 block documents for this
//   actor;
// * slot 16 is a deleting destructor that tears down `+0x3F0` and the base
//   actor, matching the `0x430`-byte allocation of [`fn_801232b0`].
//
// ## Install sites
//
// | address | store | value |
// |---|---|---|
// | `0x801232E4` | `stw r4,0x60(r31)` | `0x80324770` (in [`fn_801232b0`]) |
// | `0x801232F8` | `stw r3,0x40C(r31)` | `0x80317860` (second table) |
//
