// No data word holds the header or the first slot, so the constructor is the
// only materialisation site.
//
// ## Containment
//
// ```text
// 0x803246E8..0x80324760  seven "Wm_ob_ice*" state-name strings
// 0x80324760  0x801232B0              constructor pointer
// 0x80324764  0x00680066              two half-words (0x68, 0x66)
// 0x80324768  0x00000002              count word
// 0x8032476C  0x00000000
// 0x80324770  0x00000000 0x00000000   this header
// 0x80324778  fifty-four method words ends 0x80324850
// 0x80324850  six zero words          0x80324850..0x80324868
// 0x80324868  0xFFFFFFFF + 0x801240F0 state record (not a vtable slot)
// ```
//
// No slot crosses a boundary and all fifty-four targets are distinct main-DOL
// text addresses. None of the seven bodies below lies inside a `functions.tsv`
// row or a translated extent (`inside=[]` for all seven; the nearest previous
// `functions.tsv` row ends 4..0x3AC bytes before each).
//
// ## Census
//
// | | |
// |---|---|
// | slots | 54 (54 distinct) |
// | covered before this lane | 47 |
// | - `functions.tsv`/src body | 39 |
// | - ledger `game::player` | 7 |
// | - ledger `game::worldmap` | 1 |
// | uncovered before this lane | 7 (5 prologue-shaped + 2 leaves) |
// | prologue-shaped words in the array | 21 (`stwu` + `mflr`) |
// | targets outside main-DOL text | 0 |
// | bodies below / bytes | 7 / 1172 |
//
// ## Extent rule
//
// Extents were measured with `work/wave286/a_vt.mjs` and re-checked with
// `work/wave286/a_verify.mjs`. `bcctrl` and conditional `bc`/`bclr`/`bcctr`
// fall through; an unconditional `bclr 20,0`, unconditional `bcctr`, `bctr` or
// a forward `b` out of the body ends a path. All seven extents close on the
// returning `bclr`.
//
// ## Scan-first
