// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 0x8010FC10 - `obj_coin` slot 16 (vtable +0x48): deleting destructor
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/// Tears the coin actor down and optionally frees it.
///
/// The order is the model record at `+0x544` (`0x80169D20`, `-1`), the
/// `+0x524` packet node (`0x80069060`, `-1`), the base teardown
/// (`0x80095130(this, 0)`) and, only for a strictly positive `free_base`, the
/// allocator release `0x80162920`.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Address: `0x8010FC10`, 116 B (`0x8010FC10..0x8010FC84`; `bclr 20,0` at
///   `0x8010FC80`; three zero words then the `.ctors` body `0x8010FC90`)
/// - Table: slot 16 of `0x80322FA8`, vtable offset `+0x48`
/// - Not in `functions.tsv`; no Ghidra export
/// - Prologue `stwu sp,-0x10` / `mflr` / `stw r31,0xC` / `stw r30,8`
/// - observed: `cmpwi r3,0` / `beq` skips the whole body; `cmpwi r31,0` /
///   `ble` skips only the free
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the coin actor, or `0`.
/// * `free_base` - only a strictly positive value frees the object.
///
/// # Returns
/// `this`, unchanged (the tail `mr r3,r30`).
///
/// # Side effects
/// Two member releases, the base teardown and an optional free.
///
/// # Safety
/// A non-null `this` must be a constructed coin actor.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the guard, the destroy order and the free condition are literal.
