// The parent is the state-descriptor table `0x80328A18`, installed by
// `0x8015F7C0` ([`crate::game::task::state_descriptor_init`]). The derived
// table keeps inherited slots 1, 2, 3, 4, 6 and 7 (the four task-module bodies
// under the same wave tag) and fills slots 0, 5, 8, 9, 10 and 11 itself; slot 8
// (`0x8010B860`) was already translated, and the three bodies below are slots
// 5, 10 and 11. Slots 8..10 dispatch through the three pointer-to-member
// descriptors copied into record `+0x0C`, `+0x18` and `+0x24` from the
// `0x80322450 + n*0x24` templates. `// inferred:` the record class is the
// `dGoalManager_c` state base; the three embedded interfaces have no
// recoverable C++ names.
//
// Four of the seven uncovered targets were prologue-shaped in the pre-wave
// census, and all four are these three plus `0x8010BF90`; nothing below is
// duplicated (no `fn_<addr>` body and no semantic-named claim existed for
// these addresses).

