/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export for `0x80135CA0`.
/// - Extent: `0x80135CA0..0x80135D18` (120 bytes, 30 words), ending at the
///   `blr` at `0x80135D14`; the next body starts at `0x80135D20`.
/// - Reach: no `b`/`bl` in any image. The one data word naming it,
///   `0x80324FB4`, is the middle word of the `{0xFFFFFFFF, fn, 0}` triple at
///   `0x80324FB0`, not a three-consecutive-word pointer run.
/// - Observed: `9421FFF0 stwu r1,-0x10(r1)`; `mflr r0`; `li r4,0x37`;
///   `stw r0,0x14(r1)`; `stw r31,0xC(r1)`; `mr r31,r3`; `bl 0x80056C70`;
///   `lwz r3,0x2A64(r31)`; `addi r3,r3,0x28`; `bl 0x80169020`;
///   `cmpi cr0,r3,0`; `41820038 bc 12,2` (skip when the answer is zero);
///   `lwz r3,0x2A64(r31)`; `lis r5,0x8037`; `lfs f2,r2,-22824` (zero);
///   `addi r5,r5,0xDA0`; `lwz r12,0(r3)`; `li r4,0x3B`;
///   `FC601090 fmr f3,f2`; `lfs f1,0x2F0(r5)` (`0x80371090`);
///   `lwz r12,0x5C(r12)`; `mtspr ctr,r12`; `bcctrl`;
