// ===========================================================================
// Wave 293 lane B (`_B293`) - the two WorldMap method arrays at `0x80322DD8`
// and `0x80324A44`
// ===========================================================================
//
// Both runs are C++ method arrays preceded by a `{0,0}` header, so a table
